      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The turtle withdraws itself into its shell. Until it emerges it gain +4 bonus to AC and has advantage on Strength and Constitution saving throws. While in its shell, it is prone, its speed is 0 and can't increase, it has disadvantage on Dexerity saving throws, it can't take reactions, and the only action it can take is a bonus action to emerge from its shell.</p>",
